# ASPIRE's analysis runtime: R 4.5.3 with indicspecies 1.8.0, SpiecEasi 1.1.2, vegan and
# igraph; BLAST 2.17; python 3.11 with pandas 2.2.3, seaborn 0.13.2, umap 0.5.12, scikit-bio
# 0.7.4, plotly 5.24 and kaleido 0.2.1 (image id d2a14e44a9cf, built and checked 2026-10-01
# by docker/aspire/dev.sh --build, whose VERIFY loads every R library, imports every python
# module the vendored scripts use and exports a plotly sankey to SVG).
#
# CAUTION: the image is not on quay yet. A host runs it only after it is side-loaded into
# that host's image store: research/aspire/campaigns/cyano_r1/run_cyano.py side-load-images.
container: docker://quay.io/hallamlab/aspire:0.2.0
conda: aspire
